Description: editor for the NUX Optima Air acoustic guitar pedal
 A native editor for the NUX Optima Air (NAI-5) pedal, from a GTK 4 window
 or the command line:
  * live state and settings: active slot, preamp knobs, routing, USB
    volumes, level meters, volume and filters per slot;
  * impulse responses: the 23 slots, loading a WAV file into a slot,
    exporting a slot as WAV;
  * full backup of the 23 slots and restore of one slot or a whole backup.
 .
 Every write is preceded by an archive of the slot and followed by a read
 back. Firmware updates are not supported.
 .
 Independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by NUX.
